    "title": "How quickly are catastrophe claims triaged in the first forty-eight hours?",
    "summary": "A bounded method for measuring catastrophe triage time and the severe losses that sit behind routine notices.",
    "cluster": "Claims quality",
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-09",
